# Hebrew RTL UI

- All user-facing UI text must be in Hebrew.
- Root layout must keep `<html lang="he" dir="rtl">`.
- Use Tailwind logical utilities only: `ms/me`, `ps/pe`.
- Never use `ml/mr/pl/pr` in UI code.
- Keep mobile-first responsive behavior for every screen.
